OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer arrested on suspicion of
OL,4,Achild sex offence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA serving police officer has been
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of sexual
OL,8,Fcommunication with a child and
OL,9,Fmisconduct in a public office.
OL,11,FDurham Police said the 31-year-old had
OL,12,Fbeen arrested in the early hours of
OL,13,FFriday.
OL,15,FIt said the officer remained in police
OL,16,Fcustody and had been immediately
OL,17,Fsuspended from his role pending a
OL,18,Fcriminal investigation.
OL,20,FThe BBC understands the officer was
OL,21,Farrested off duty and taken into
OL,22,Fcustody in a different force area.
